+
+\MMFS-compatible Tube destination selection. The Tube host marks parasite
+\addresses with &FFFF in the upper half of the OSFILE address. OSBYTE &EA
+\returns X=&FF only when Tube transfer services are currently available.
+.tube_prepare
+	LDA	#0
+	STA	tube_active
+	LDA	CFSload+2
+	AND	CFSload+3
+	CMP	#&FF
+	BNE	tube_prepare_done
+	LDA	#&EA
+	LDX	#0
+	LDY	#&FF
+	JSR	OSBYTE
+	CPX	#&FF
+	BNE	tube_prepare_done
+.tube_claim
+	LDA	#&C0+tubeid
+	JSR	TubeCode
+	BCC	tube_claim
+	LDX	#<CFSload
+	LDY	#>CFSload
+	LDA	#1		\multi-byte host-to-parasite transfer
+	JSR	TubeCode
+	LDA	#&FF
+	STA	tube_active
+.tube_prepare_done
+	RTS
+
+\Preserve the load result flags while releasing the filing-system Tube claim.
+.tube_release
+	PHP
+	PHA
+	LDA	tube_active
+	BEQ	tube_release_done
+	LDA	#&80+tubeid
+	JSR	TubeCode
+	LDA	#0
+	STA	tube_active
+.tube_release_done
+	PLA
+	PLP
+	RTS
 
